  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large pan over medium heat",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and saute until fragrant",
    "Add the doubanjiang and saute for another minute",
    "Add the spinach puree and stir well",
    "Add the paneer cheese and stir gently until the cheese is well coated",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes",
    "Season with coriander powder and serve hot"
